  <p>Is Institutional Review Board (IRB) approval required? <span data-field="irb_required">{{ irb_required }}</span> or <span data-field="irb_not_required">{{ irb_not_required }}</span></p>
  <p>Is Institutional Animal Care and Use Committee (IACUC) approval required? <span data-field="iacuc_required">{{ iacuc_required }}</span> or <span data-field="iacuc_not_required">{{ iacuc_not_required }}</span></p>
